scsikrno: Linux kernel version 1.1.18, with SCSI + IDE support. 
scsikrno:
scsikrno: This is a Linux kernel with full support for SCSI devices such as hard
scsikrno: drives, tape drives, and CD-ROM drives. See the file 'scsikern.log' 
scsikrno: for an exact list of included drivers.
scsikrno:
scsikrno: This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, ethernet,
scsikrno: Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
